      "order": 29,
      "block_id": "16d11ac0-cf4a-42ac-9e5c-e4aee18faf3f",
      "source_hash": "ebef07ee8e4c478b36de2c4cb62f89c05974fd484987c6815a71e504410092d9",
      "markdown": "[교재 8개 판본과 관찰된 섹션 256개](library-file:fde1_bGliZmlsZV8zd1VlVjc4OTNDMEZ1LWlGQzFYeDlR_FileDrive_73e3d24e44d881918a9b9622fd5a4193)",
      "interpretation": "source_snapshot_not_new_teacher_verdict"
    },
